        "number": 319,
        "content": "<div class=\"chapter-header\">\n  <h2 class=\"chapter-title\">Nine Leaf Sword Grass, Silver Luminance Battle Armor (Part 3)</h2>\n  <span class=\"chapter-number\">Chapter 319</span>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"chapter-divider\">\n10,000 Years In A Cultivation Sect: I Ob... \nChapter 319: Nine Leaf Sword Grass, Silver Luminance Battle Armor (Part 3)\n  \n“I am Tai Jian, not a eunuch!”\n\n“A eunuch is a eunuch!”\n\n“You’ve completely angered me!” Tai Jian inexplicably became furious and he was done talking about it, “I’ll kill you first and then the Great Demon Venerate! Yu Fei, watch the battle for me!”\n\n“Alright! If you kill him, I will accompany you for 1,000 years!” Yu Fei said tenderly.\n\n“Haha! Wonderful!” Tai Jian chuckled twice before his long sword turned and an aura that could pierce through heaven rose into the sky, causing the Abyss to tremble and the nine illusionment to howl.\n!!\n\n“I still remember when my master once said that a grain of soil can fill the sea, and a single blade of grass can cut down even the moon!”\n\n“This first slash is called the Moon Slash!”\n\nClang!\n\nThe sword qi was of extreme Yang and rigidity. It was invincible and seemed as though it existed specifically to destroy the Extreme Yin Stellar that represented the land of extreme yin.\n\nAs Jiang Ming moved his foot, an illusory long river appeared, mighty and surging. It was the long river of history.\n\nAt the beginning of the long river, a figure could be seen walking out of it. It was the Past Body.\n\nAt an unknown distance following the flow of the river, another figure could also be seen walking out of it. It was the Future body.\n\nThe Present Body on the other hand appeared directly, raising one finger of his hand. The three fingers combined the power of destruction of body, destruction of soul and destruction of heart into one and exploded into a devastating blow of Dao energy that smashed through the sword slash.\n\nThe three clones launched their attacks at the same time.\n\n“This special ability is amazing!” Tai Jian exclaimed. Billions of sword lights spewed out of his body, turning into a performance of a world of swords, distorting even the laws of the Abyss.\n\nHow terrifying was that of a Sword Dao this was?\n\nHowever, the three clones were not afraid at all.\n\nBoom…\n\nThe great battle broke out as the sky of the Abyss was drowned by the surging powers in an instant.\n\nThe sword slash that cut through anything and everything.\n\nThe technique that destroyed the infinite laws.\n\nThese two powers continuously intertwined with each other.\n\nIn an instant, the radius of 100,000 miles was smashed into chaos. Void vortices, black hole cracks and the likes appeared from time to time.\n\nThe Abyss was under great damage again.\n\nThe earth cracked and the sky collapsed.\n\nA group of experts who came to the Abyss to decimate the Great Demon Venerate also gathered around to watch this peerless great battle.\n\nJiang Ming stood on the long river of history and watched silently.\n\nIf Tai Jian had no other means up his sleeves, he would be able to suppress the opponent with his three clones.\n\nHowever, knowing the background of this opponent of his, it was almost impossible to win the fight easily.\n\nWhether it’s his status as the great disciple of the Saint or the supreme elder of the Taishang Sword Sect, his background was absolutely terrifying.\n\nHe felt some vague murderous intent.\n\nWithout having to look for it carefully, he could also guess that they were very likely coming from the Venerates of the Taishang Sword Sect.\n\nBeing a Sacred Land, it’s unjustified not to have a few Venerates among them.\n\nBoom…\n\nThe great torrent exploded and Tai Jian was blasted thousands of miles away. Blood dripped from the corner of his mouth and the look on his face was extremely bad.\n\nAt this moment, a piece of armor appeared on his body, shining with silver luminance and flowing with endless scriptures, protecting his whole body.\n\n“You actually forced out my Silver Luminance Battle Armor!” Tai Jian’s voice was solemn and the sword qi that revolved around his body kept disillusioning, “This is the life-saving item that Master specially refined for me before he left. I didn’t even evoke it when I was against the Great Demon Venerate. I didn’t expect to be so embarrassed by you, a little guy who is not yet of the Great Overarching Golden Immortal Realm!”\n\n“If it wasn’t because of this armor, you’d be dead!” Jiang Ming snorted, “Tai Jian! Just retreat and we’ll let this skirmish be over!”\n\n“Haha…” Tai Jian laughed wildly in the sky, “I am a disciple of the Saint Lord, the supreme elder of the Sacred Land. To think that I’ve been given alms of retreat? This is a humiliation to me. Jiang Ming, in this Abyss today, if it’s not the burial of yours, then it would be of mine!”\n\n“Then die!” Jiang Ming howled as he launched his attacks.\n\n---\n*End of Chapter 319*\n",
