        "number": 334,
        "content": "<div class=\"chapter-header\">\n  <h2 class=\"chapter-title\">Descended into the Tiancang Great Chiliocosm (Part 1)</h2>\n  <span class=\"chapter-number\">Chapter 334</span>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"chapter-divider\">\n10,000 Years In A Cultivation Sect: I Ob... \nChapter 334: Descended into the Tiancang Great Chiliocosm (Part 1)\n  \nThe atmosphere got rather ambiguous to the point that some pinkish mist was produced.\n\nXi Yao had been facizing. It was uncontrollable. Even if she had tried evoking the sword of wisdom to cut off the love, she bagan facizing again immediately after she had cut it off.\n\nJiang Ming was restless while reading the Human Path Record.\n\nIt was at this time that Junior Sister Phoenix paced over through the air and landed aside. When she took a glance at the flustering Xi Yao and looked at Jiang Ming who appeared to be calm, she pouted.\n\nWithout any scruple, she lay beside Jiang Ming. While pointing to the other side of Jiang Ming, she said generously, “Xi Yao, you can take the place at that side of Senior Brother!”\n!!\n\n“What are you talking about!” Xi Yao forcefully suppressed her restlessness and glared at Linglong, “That’s your man!”\n\n“I can share him with you!” Junior Sister Phoenix snickered, “He’s a donkey after all. Do you want to have a ride?”\n\n“Linglong!” Xi Yao suddenly rose to her feet and blushed. She raised her voice before abruptly lowering it, “If you do it again, I won’t care about you anymore!”\n\n“It’s up to you!” Junior Sister Phoenix pouted, “I’ve given you a chance after all!”\n\nXi Yao snorted but she couldn’t help taking a glance at Jiang Ming.\n\nJunior Sister Phoenix rolled her eyes and had her head pillowed on Jiang Ming’s chest.\n\n“You little girl is so mean!” Jiang Ming said helplessly.\n\n“Don’t you think I don’t know what you are thinking about!” Junior Sister Phoenix snorted, “You must be thinking: I have my Junior Sister in my left embrace but my right hand is empty. Xi Yao, quickly come to my right embrace.”\n\nJiang Ming was left speechless. He felt somewhat embarrassed too because he had the thought indeed. It was every man’s dream to be able to have two beauties on both sides.\n\nAlthough he had 10 Junior Sisters, they were still his one Junior Sister.\n\nXi Yao gnashed her teeth, stamped her feet and left through the air, “Linglong, are you trying to chase me away?”\n\n“How can I do that?” Junior Sister Phoenix raised her voice, “Xi Yao, I’ve given you the last chance. I won’t help you from now onwards. This is my man and you don’t even appreciate it even though I’m trying to share with you. Sigh!”\n\nXi Yao didn’t respond. She returned to her home and activated some simple formation she had built to disconnect the external area with a wave.\n\nHer home was covered with mist and surrounded by immortal luminance in an instant.\n\nShe sat on a stone bench in her courtyard and her face looked even red. She stared blankly while holding her head and pouted.\n\n“What can I do?”\n\n“Ahhh…”\n\nAfter a while, she rubbed her hair irritably. She wanted to just go away but she didn’t know where to go. Moreover, she didn’t want to leave here.\n\nLife was indeed full of confusion.\n\n…\n\nIn the balcony on the roof was an interaction between souls.\n\n“Senior Brother, do you really like her?” Junior Sister Phoenix asked.\n\n“My heart can only accommodate 10 people!” Jiang Ming replied honestly.\n\n“Really?”\n\n“Really!”\n\n“The main body and the nine of us?”\n\n“You’re talking shit, aren’t you?”\n\n“Can shit talk?”\n\n“Why don’t you smell it?”\n\n“Senior Brother, you’re so shameless!”\n\n“Alas, it’s not that you haven’t smelled it before.”\n\n“Be careful that I’ll sit on your face again!”\n\nLife was that boring. They were having another type of feeling while enjoying their intimacy.\n\nIn just a blink of an eye, it was eventually the auction day.\n\nWhen the sun rose from the east, Jiang Ming woke up from his cultivation. It was important to cultivate but he could do it after he enjoyed such a beautiful morning.\n\nHe cooked some porridge with some simple dishes, and ate them alone.\n\nAs for his Junior Sister Phoenix, she was too tired due to the heavy exercise yesterday night. Hence, she had gone cultivating.\n\nHe wanted to call Xi Yao but he was afraid he couldn’t hold back his restlessness, and started exercising again. He was also afraid of his waist condition if his Junior Sister found out and joined in.\n\nAlas! He had no choice but to take care of his own body.\n\nAfter he had a satisfying meal, he received the rewards.\n\n“DIng: Congratulations to the host for finally having a quiet breakfast. You are rewarded with the three-minutes scream of Yu Fei (Note: you can send it to a specified location without others noticing).\n\nJiang Ming was startled and then rather speechless at the reward he had received.\n\nThe three-minutes scream of Yu Fei? He was wondering why the system would be so unserious.\n\n‘But…’ As he pinched his chin, he thought of an idea and couldn’t help but smile.\n\nHe looked above the Tianyuan Sea and saw a great amount of experts. There were even hundreds of Great Overarching Golden Immortals. It was obvious that they were here to join the auction.\n\n‘I’m afraid that they aren’t coming from the Heavenly Realm only!’ Jiang Ming pondered. He expected that there were strong experts coming from some middle chiliocosms too. They were of the largest group of people, even the number of humans among them was high too.\n\nThe auction house had yet to open its door.\n\nJiang Ming was not in a hurry. He brewed a cup of tea and was enjoying it slowly. He lay on a rattan chair, leisurely swaying while calling up the Human Path Record to check out various conditions.\n\nIn general, the Honggu Heavenly Realm was still in a peaceful state. However, Yu Fei was trying to get supporters to have her enthroned as the Heavenly Emperor. She even allured many old stagers.\n\n‘She even counts me in her plan!’ Jiang Ming was rather speechless. He didn’t care how lecherous she was, but he cared that she was full of men’s aura. By just thinking of her having sex with different men, he was disgusted.\n\n‘She even thought of trying out Riyue Changfeng after the auction? She wants to buy off the Fo Sect?’ Jiang Ming felt funny. He thought it would be easier if Yu Fei set up a stage so that she would get the top 10 to date her.\n\nHe continued flipping the Human Path Record.\n\n---\n*End of Chapter 334*\n",
